      "rationale": {
        "summary": "Twelve entity type 13 Flies at 3 HP each; wiki data says regular Flies cannot damage Isaac by touch, so the plan prioritizes efficient clearing rather than hard evasion. Normal tears deal 3.5 damage, enough for one-shot kills, so target.finish_first avoids spreading damage. Flies have negligible drift, making direct aim with movement inheritance sufficient. Keep-range positioning near 0.45-0.7 of effective range maintains firing lanes while allowing the player to close on distant flies at 240-339 px. The interior obstacle at grid 67 is confirmed walkable-blocking collision class 3 and lies between spawn and the lower cluster, so positioning and local repath should avoid firing or pathing straight through it. Minimal-shift evasion and kept escape routes remain as safeguards because the fly harmlessness reading is wiki-derived and unverified in-run. No items, bombs, cards or pills are used.",
